  "representation": {
   "plain_text": "Algorithm 1 Workflow of MasRouter Input :Benchmark D, encoder f ψ (•), fusion module g ϕ (•), learning rate α, search space S = {M, R, T} for query Q ∈ D do for iteration t ∈ {1, 2, • • • , K} do /* Collaboration Mode Determination */ Sample latent vector H ∼ N (µ t (Q), diag(σ 2 t (Q))) ▷ Eq.(7) Compute collaboration mode probability: p(T |H) ∝ exp(f ψ (Q) ⊤ Hτ /τ ) Determine agent count: k = ⌈δ(H) • γ⌉ ▷ Dynamic scaling /* Agent Role Allocation */ for ℓ = 1 to k do Compute role probability: π rℓ ∝ exp(H ⊤ R ℓ-1 H R ℓ /τ ) Select role R ℓ via cascaded inference // Eq.(9) /* Agent LLM Routing */ Aggregate context: H M = FFN(H ⊕ H T ⊕ H R i ) for each agent i ∈ {1, ..., k} do Compute LLM compatibility: π m (M i ) ∝ exp(H ⊤ M H M i /τ ) // Eq.(11) Assign LLM M i with multinomial sampling /* Optimization */ Compute reward R = U (S; Q, a) -λ • C(S; Q) // Eq.(3) Update θ via policy gradient: θ ← θ -α∇ θ E[-R] // Section 4.4"
  },
